    "title": "Quran Majeed Pro - Quran App",
    "description": "It's good to see you here. Are you looking for an easy way to access the Quran Majeed app? You are in the right place.<b>Quran Majeed 16 Line: Quran app</b>is an effective way for daily recitation, listening and reading Quran Majeed anywhere, anytime. Al- Quran ul Kareem offers a user-friendly interface and features like bookmark option, resume button, verses and surah in index (list) format.\r\nRead Quran Majeed and listening Quranic Arabic app is a reminder for us that Allah is present everywhere all the time. Quran Pak app solves the issue of carrying the Holy Quran offline 30 para.\r\n\r\n<b>Here are some key features of Quran Majeed 16 line: Quran App.</b>   \r\n\r\n16 line Quran Majeed App.\r\nListen and read Quran MP3 full.\r\nQuran Kareem Offline.\r\nQuran MP3  full with multiple Qurras.\r\nJuzz and Surah index feature.\r\nAdd or delete the bookmark feature.\r\n16 line Quranic Arabic app.\r\nAl- Quran ul Kareem app.\r\nQuran Pak with day and night mode features.\r\nRecite and Listen to Quran Majeed.\r\nBest audio voices of Al Quran reciters.\r\nAl Quran provides user- friendly interface.\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>16 line Quran Majeed App:</b>  \r\nQuran Majeed 16 line format specially designed for those Muslims who memorize Quran Pak completely in their heart (Hafiz). 16 Line Quran Pak app is easy for all Muslims as each page is optimized with clarity, making Quran Sharif reading perfect for both small and large screens. Al-Qur'an app helps to memorize or read and listen Holy Quran to improve our religious worship.\r\n\r\n<b>Quran MP3 full:</b>\r\nQuran MP3 app feature provides a comprehensive list of reciters. Al Quran app offers a wide range of reciters' beautiful voices, allowing you to easily listen to the Holy Quran. Simply click on the reciter list option and select your favourite Quran Majeed reciter. Quran Pak 30 Para includes multiple Quran Majeed reciters such as Mufti Menk, Saud Al-Shuraim, Ahmad Al-Ajmi, and Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais, among others.\r\n\r\n\r\n<b> Juzz and surah index with easy Navigation:</b>\r\nAl- Quran ul Kareem app provide Juzz (1 - 30) and surah (114) index features. Quran Pak gives you time saving feature you don\u2019t need to explore the whole Quran Majeed app because search functionality is available in the Quran Majeed app. In the Quran Pak offline app, easily find the Parah or Surah you want to listen or read with user-friendly navigation.\r\n\r\n<b>Bookmark and Resume Button:</b>\r\nAl Quran app provides bookmark option and resume button. Add or delete any surah from your favourite list through the bookmark option in Quran Pak app. The resume button helps you to read the Holy Quran offline where you left off. So you don't need to search entire pages of Quran Majeed.\r\n\r\n<b> Change Language and Font  colour option:</b>\r\nAl-Quran ul Kareem offers a feature to switch Al Quran app language, making it easier to understand and read Quranic Arabic. Quran Pak app also provides customizable font options. You can choose your favourite colour and font style for personalized Quran Pak reading experience.\r\n\r\n<b> Listen and read Quran with day and night mode:</b>\r\nQuran Pak provides the features of day and night mode. Whether you are reciting the  Holy Quran during the day or night, these modes will help for reading Al Quran experience.\r\n\r\n<b>Listen and Read Holy Quran:</b>\r\nQuran Pak app offers a feature to read Holy Quran offline. You can read Al Quran without Internet after getting Quran Majeed app on your phone. Also through the Internet, you can listen Quran Pak of your favourite reciter with easy navigation.\r\n\r\nQuranic Arabic app helps to enhance your spiritual practices and live your life according to Islam. If you want to read or memorize verses, surah or Azkar so <b>Quran Majeed 16 Line: Quran app</b> provides everything in one place. Let,s Click the button and get <b>Quran Majeed 16 Line: Quran App</b> on your phone and bring the beauty of Islam in your daily routine.",
